TITLE Pure water equilibrated with CH4-CO2-NH3 gas at 150C, P=1 atm
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    redox pe
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 150
    CH4(g) 0.4 10
    CO2(g) 0.4 10
    NH3(g) 0.2 5
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -pH true
END
